		"_postman_id": "legal-practice-api-collection",
		"name": "Legal Practice Management API",
		"description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for testing the Legal Practice Management Django REST API. This collection includes all CRUD operations, filtering, searching, and custom endpoints.\n\n## Getting Started\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set up the environment variables (base_url)\n3. Start your Django server: `python manage.py runserver`\n4. Populate test data: `python manage.py populate_test_data --clear`\n5. Start testing the APIs!\n\n## Features Covered\n- Client management\n- Lawyer management with monthly billing\n- Mandate management with active/inactive filtering\n- Time entry tracking\n- Search and filtering capabilities\n- Cost calculations and summaries",
